    {
      "uid": "zhcn:194c2930bf6835a25288337b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是一个连我自己也同样在意的疑问。\n为什么她无论跑输几次都要继续奔跑？\n要是她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f61cd307fb3dca88639e47a0c52a1bdae58f1f528eb1d68de7af28795d833a8e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
